    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. we're trying to figure out why it happened so it doesn't happen again. the mechanic is looking at the unit now but couldn't find a clear mechanical cause—no blown fuses, no leaks, just suddenly stopped working out of nowhere. it feels like someone or something messed with the wiring, but there's no sign of tampering. any idea why a unit would just quit like that without a clear failure point?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
